{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ocean depths, a society of merpeople begins to undergo <strong>evolution</strong> and discovers <strong>casual relationships</strong>. After a <strong>painful breakup</strong>, the solitary protagonist undergoes a journey of self-discovery and self-denial as they experiment with intimacy, experience physical bodily changes, and try to decide whether or not they want to move to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>coalescent || tidal rapture </i>is a hypnagogic 3D <strong>swimming/entanglement\u00a0</strong>adventure 3rd-person computer game. It features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two primary gameplay modes</strong> \u2013 swimming and entanglement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reverse coming-of-age story about a swimmer unlearning normalcy in order to embrace (or not) the new and primal told in three chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three surreal cave-based collaged underwater worlds depicted in low-poly 3D and 2D pixel art character and object sprites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three sexy, mysterious and colorful partners who aquaint the protagonist with a different sort of entanglement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765790/extras/f2a55b3f0d09fe28b843494732d6f793.avif?t=1771526945\" width=415 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro swimming push-and-pull swimming style inspired by the likes of <i>Super Mario 64</i>, <i>Ecco the Dolphin</i>, and <i>b.l.u.e. Legend of Water</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic atmospheric electronic soundtrack with interactive musical plants and fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A five-note singing system with pitch modulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sing and harmonize with a quirky cast of merpeople characters to establish a telepathic bond and talk about life underwater and what it must be like on the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every season, every merpeople migrates together to the next world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765790/extras/d55209303cead8f69407c2305f8b2c62.avif?t=1771526945\" width=510 height=105 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four phases: foreplay, main act, climax, and aftercare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a long and sinuous organ coming out of the characters' back and thrust, entangle, and tie knots with your partner's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different touch-based communication styles as the merpeople cuddle and discuss their newfound intimacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765790/extras/cdf295cd5238c785592321a7cec610f8.poster.avif?t=1771526945\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765790/extras/cdf295cd5238c785592321a7cec610f8.webm?t=1771526945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765790?t=1771526945","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765790/7f2a08b81d13ec31d37d15ebfefcf0e90bfd02d8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771526945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765790/b99050148cf4c2c7ff818929dd318aaf7f9b2bd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771526945","